  data: {
    LLM: 'As kankei, declare kan when your hand has control cards and access to likely point tricks rather than waiting too long for a lower threshold.\n\nAs mukankei, coordinate by forcing awkward leads and protecting point cards in suits where kankei appears short.\n\nTrack exposed point cards and timing around joker usage; denying one key trick often flips the whole deal because total scoring cards are limited.',
    Player: 'As kankei, declare kan when your hand has control cards and access to likely point tricks rather than waiting too long for a lower threshold.\n\nAs mukankei, coordinate by forcing awkward leads and protecting point cards in suits where kankei appears short.\n\nTrack exposed point cards and timing around joker usage; denying one key trick often flips the whole deal because total scoring cards are limited.',
